+A non-empty default mapping keyed by full long option names can select a
+default from stringified dependency values. Dynamic dependencies resolve
+first only when their source is still `DEFAULT`; explicitly selected
+dependency values remain unchanged. The same source rule applies to the
+target. Help marks these defaults as dynamic.
+
